-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SCOPE OF THIS COPY

The NPB 3.4.3 benchmark code in this directory is unmodified and remains under
the NPB license reproduced above.

Instrumentation for the PactOMP dynamic resource manager (DRM) is not applied
to the benchmarks themselves: it lives in a patched LLVM OpenMP runtime outside
this repository, which the benchmark binaries load dynamically at run time.

Files added alongside the benchmark code — build scripts (build_omp.sh), SLURM
launch scripts (run_*.sbatch, test_*.sh), analysis code, configuration, and the
retained measurement data under benchmarks/ — are Copyright 2026 Darius
Augsburger and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the LICENSE
and NOTICE files at the root of this repository.
